<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#F5F7FA',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', width: '100%', height: '100%', gap: 40 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 360, paddingTop: 20 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 12 }}>WHY LOCAL</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.35, marginBottom: 24 }}>
        为什么需要<br />本地大模型
      </Text>
      <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#22D3EE', marginBottom: 24 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
        本地不是替代云，而是多一种选择——<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F' }}>免费、可控、隐私</span>三大理由，让开发者愿意自建。
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 20, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '22px 26px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 56, borderRadius: 14, background: '#EAF2FB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <FAIcon name='dollar' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 28, height: 28 }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 6 }}>免费</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>不按 API 计费 · 调用次数无限制</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '22px 26px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 56, borderRadius: 14, background: '#EAF2FB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <FAIcon name='cog' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 28, height: 28 }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 6 }}>可控</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>自己掌控模型与调用 · 不受厂商限流</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '22px 26px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 56, borderRadius: 14, background: '#EAF2FB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <FAIcon name='lock' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 28, height: 28 }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 6 }}>隐私</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>数据不出门 · 企业敏感信息更安全</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: '#16263F', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 26px', marginTop: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
          云 API 也要了解：DeepSeek V4-Flash 官方 API 仅 $0.14 / 百万 input token
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', width: 'calc(100% - 120px)' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 2 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>02 / 12</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
